{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 5.025, "t": "Almost every drink on a coffee shop menu starts with the exact same thing:", "k": ["Almost"], "w": [0.12, 0.576, 0.968, 1.36, 1.563, 1.702, 2.158, 2.487, 2.816, 3.272, 3.601, 3.867, 4.259, 4.588]}, {"a": 5.025, "b": 6.84, "t": "one shot of espresso.", "k": ["espresso."], "w": [5.075, 5.341, 5.67, 5.873]}, {"a": 6.84, "b": 10.814, "t": "What changes is just three things: how much water you add,", "k": ["changes"], "w": [6.89, 7.222, 7.746, 7.951, 8.283, 8.679, 9.235, 9.503, 9.836, 10.232, 10.5]}, {"a": 10.814, "b": 13.479999999999999, "t": "how much milk, and how much foam.", "k": ["milk,"], "w": [10.864, 11.133, 11.465, 11.893, 12.161, 12.43, 12.762]}, {"a": 13.479999999999999, "b": 15.747, "t": "Once you understand those 3 things,", "k": ["3"], "w": [13.53, 13.82, 14.054, 14.677, 15.023, 15.312]}, {"a": 15.747, "b": 18.61, "t": "you can read any coffee menu in the world.", "k": ["coffee"], "w": [15.797, 16.031, 16.265, 16.554, 16.788, 17.189, 17.479, 17.657, 17.891]}, {"a": 18.61, "b": 22.153, "t": "So today, we will build 10 drinks from the same shot,", "k": ["10"], "w": [18.66, 18.842, 19.279, 19.461, 19.756, 20.108, 20.585, 20.994, 21.289, 21.528, 21.823]}, {"a": 22.153, "b": 26.15, "t": "one by one, and you will finally know what you are ordering.", "k": ["ordering."], "w": [22.203, 22.442, 22.623, 22.947, 23.186, 23.424, 23.719, 24.185, 24.48, 24.775, 25.014, 25.252]}, {"a": 26.15, "b": 30.07, "t": "Drink number one is the base of everything: the espresso.", "k": ["everything:"], "w": [26.2, 26.564, 26.986, 27.233, 27.421, 27.667, 27.972, 28.16, 28.906, 29.152]}, {"a": 30.07, "b": 34.262, "t": "Hot water is pushed through finely ground coffee under pressure,", "k": ["pressure,"], "w": [30.12, 30.381, 30.766, 30.965, 31.412, 31.921, 32.368, 32.815, 33.263, 33.648]}, {"a": 34.262, "b": 37.540000000000006, "t": "usually in about 25 to 30 seconds.", "k": ["25", "30"], "w": [34.312, 34.822, 35.02, 35.405, 35.927, 36.126, 36.648]}, {"a": 37.540000000000006, "b": 42.722, "t": "That pressure is the secret: it pulls out a lot of flavor in very little time,", "k": ["pressure"], "w": [37.59, 37.914, 38.487, 38.686, 38.948, 39.49, 39.689, 40.075, 40.337, 40.474, 40.735, 40.934, 41.383, 41.582, 41.906, 42.354]}, {"a": 42.722, "b": 46.35, "t": "and creates the golden foam on top, called crema.", "k": ["creates"], "w": [42.772, 43.033, 43.544, 43.805, 44.254, 44.578, 44.777, 45.132, 45.58]}, {"a": 46.35, "b": 51.440000000000005, "t": "A single shot is small, around 30 milliliters, which is about 1 ounce.", "k": ["30", "1"], "w": [46.4, 46.525, 46.936, 47.233, 47.415, 47.854, 48.265, 48.744, 49.525, 49.878, 50.061, 50.414, 50.711]}, {"a": 51.440000000000005, "b": 54.75, "t": "Now, the first thing we can change is the water.", "k": ["change"], "w": [51.49, 51.816, 52.055, 52.41, 52.764, 52.946, 53.186, 53.598, 53.78, 54.02]}, {"a": 54.75, "b": 58.625, "t": "Use less water with the same coffee, and you get a ristretto,", "k": ["ristretto,"], "w": [54.8, 55.049, 55.357, 55.724, 56.032, 56.281, 56.589, 57.105, 57.353, 57.602, 57.851, 57.981]}, {"a": 58.625, "b": 63.1, "t": "which means restricted in Italian: shorter, thicker, and sweeter.", "k": ["restricted"], "w": [58.675, 59.042, 59.409, 60.073, 60.262, 60.837, 61.412, 61.986, 62.235]}, {"a": 63.1, "b": 68.09700000000001, "t": "Push more water through the same coffee, and you get a lungo, which means long:", "k": ["through"], "w": [63.15, 63.457, 63.765, 64.132, 64.616, 64.865, 65.172, 65.687, 65.935, 66.184, 66.432, 66.562, 67.017, 67.384, 67.751]}, {"a": 68.09700000000001, "b": 73.67, "t": "a bigger cup, but more bitter, because the water keeps pulling out the harsh parts.", "k": ["bitter,"], "w": [68.147, 68.277, 68.703, 69.04, 69.288, 69.595, 70.11, 70.595, 70.843, 71.21, 71.576, 72.061, 72.31, 72.558, 72.925]}, {"a": 73.67, "b": 75.4, "t": "Before we add anything else,", "k": ["anything"], "w": [73.72, 74.128, 74.31, 74.548, 75.07]}, {"a": 75.4, "b": 78.86, "t": "there is one more change: two shots instead of one.", "k": ["change:"], "w": [75.45, 75.802, 75.983, 76.222, 76.517, 77.01, 77.248, 77.6, 78.065, 78.247]}, {"a": 78.86, "b": 82.479, "t": "That is a doppio, which simply means double in Italian,", "k": ["Italian,"], "w": [78.91, 79.229, 79.425, 79.56, 80.094, 80.474, 80.916, 81.296, 81.737, 81.934]}, {"a": 82.479, "b": 86.48, "t": "and many coffee shops now use it as their standard base.", "k": ["standard"], "w": [82.529, 82.786, 83.105, 83.547, 83.927, 84.184, 84.442, 84.638, 84.835, 85.215, 85.779]}, {"a": 86.48, "b": 90.119, "t": "And here is a surprise: espresso tastes much stronger,", "k": ["surprise:"], "w": [86.53, 86.794, 87.122, 87.323, 87.462, 88.136, 88.715, 89.168, 89.496]}, {"a": 90.119, "b": 95.78, "t": "but a single shot usually has less caffeine than a regular mug of filter coffee.", "k": ["caffeine"], "w": [90.169, 90.434, 90.572, 91.026, 91.353, 91.869, 92.134, 92.461, 93.041, 93.368, 93.507, 94.023, 94.287, 94.489, 94.942]}, {"a": 95.78, "b": 100.924, "t": "The Mayo Clinic lists about 63 milligrams for one ounce of espresso,", "k": ["63"], "w": [95.83, 96.11, 96.457, 96.937, 97.351, 97.765, 98.325, 99.072, 99.352, 99.633, 100.046, 100.26]}, {"a": 100.924, "b": 105.66, "t": "and about 96 milligrams for an 8-ounce cup of brewed coffee.", "k": ["96", "8-ounce"], "w": [100.974, 101.254, 101.667, 102.228, 102.975, 103.255, 103.469, 103.816, 104.096, 104.309, 104.79]}, {"a": 105.66, "b": 110.685, "t": "Espresso is more concentrated, but a mug of filter coffee is a lot bigger,", "k": ["concentrated,"], "w": [105.71, 106.297, 106.501, 106.832, 107.77, 108.038, 108.178, 108.446, 108.65, 109.109, 109.568, 109.772, 109.913, 110.181]}, {"a": 110.685, "b": 113.57000000000001, "t": "so you end up drinking more caffeine.", "k": ["caffeine."], "w": [110.735, 110.939, 111.207, 111.475, 111.679, 112.266, 112.598]}, {"a": 113.57000000000001, "b": 118.8, "t": "Drink number four adds the water after the shot is made: the americano.", "k": ["americano."], "w": [113.62, 114.021, 114.487, 114.823, 115.159, 115.431, 115.832, 116.233, 116.505, 116.841, 117.048, 117.482, 117.753]}, {"a": 118.8, "b": 122.059, "t": "It is simply espresso with hot water poured on top,", "k": ["espresso"], "w": [118.85, 119.041, 119.233, 119.663, 120.214, 120.525, 120.776, 121.146, 121.577, 121.768]}, {"a": 122.059, "b": 125.85000000000001, "t": "so it tastes closer to a regular cup of filter coffee.", "k": ["regular"], "w": [122.109, 122.301, 122.492, 122.923, 123.353, 123.545, 123.676, 124.167, 124.418, 124.609, 125.04]}, {"a": 125.85000000000001, "b": 133.124, "t": "There is a popular story that American soldiers in Italy during World War Two asked for water in their espresso,", "k": ["espresso,"], "w": [125.9, 126.284, 126.482, 126.618, 127.126, 127.51, 127.831, 128.401, 128.97, 129.169, 129.552, 129.998, 130.382, 130.642, 130.902, 131.286, 131.546, 131.93, 132.128, 132.511]}, {"a": 133.124, "b": 136.07, "t": "to make it taste like coffee from home.", "k": ["coffee"], "w": [133.174, 133.372, 133.694, 133.892, 134.276, 134.598, 135.043, 135.365]}, {"a": 136.07, "b": 139.48, "t": "It is a great story, but nobody has ever proven it,", "k": ["story,"], "w": [136.12, 136.318, 136.515, 136.651, 137.034, 137.51, 137.769, 138.214, 138.474, 138.795, 139.24]}, {"a": 139.48, "b": 142.04999999999998, "t": "so take it with a grain of sugar.", "k": ["sugar."], "w": [139.53, 139.728, 140.049, 140.247, 140.568, 140.704, 141.087, 141.284]}, {"a": 142.04999999999998, "b": 145.10999999999999, "t": "Now we start adding milk, a little at a time.", "k": ["adding"], "w": [142.1, 142.333, 142.511, 142.855, 143.255, 143.627, 143.749, 144.148, 144.326, 144.448]}, {"a": 145.10999999999999, "b": 151.04, "t": "Drink number five is the macchiato, which means stained, or marked, in Italian.", "k": ["macchiato,"], "w": [145.16, 145.57, 146.045, 146.389, 146.6, 146.878, 147.651, 148.061, 148.47, 149.111, 149.323, 149.898, 150.109]}, {"a": 151.04, "b": 153.249, "t": "It is an espresso marked with just", "k": ["espresso"], "w": [151.09, 151.284, 151.478, 151.673, 152.231, 152.668, 152.984]}, {"a": 153.249, "b": 155.78, "t": "a small spot of milk foam on top.", "k": ["small"], "w": [153.299, 153.433, 153.809, 154.124, 154.319, 154.634, 154.95, 155.144]}, {"a": 155.78, "b": 159.143, "t": "Be careful, because in many big coffee chains,", "k": ["careful,"], "w": [155.83, 156.047, 156.705, 157.26, 157.477, 157.83, 158.115, 158.603]}, {"a": 159.143, "b": 164.54, "t": "a macchiato is a large sweet milk drink, which is almost the opposite.", "k": ["macchiato"], "w": [159.193, 159.342, 160.033, 160.25, 160.399, 160.82, 161.24, 161.592, 162.114, 162.535, 162.752, 163.24, 163.525]}, {"a": 164.54, "b": 168.64, "t": "Drink number six comes from Spain: the cortado.", "k": ["cortado."], "w": [164.59, 165.051, 165.586, 165.898, 166.359, 166.745, 167.317, 167.629]}, {"a": 168.64, "b": 171.52499999999998, "t": "The name comes from cortar, which means to cut,", "k": ["cortar,"], "w": [168.69, 168.929, 169.224, 169.576, 169.871, 170.365, 170.718, 171.07, 171.251]}, {"a": 171.52499999999998, "b": 175.95999999999998, "t": "because the espresso is cut with about the same amount of warm milk.", "k": ["espresso"], "w": [171.575, 172.041, 172.279, 172.802, 172.984, 173.222, 173.518, 173.87, 174.108, 174.403, 174.812, 174.994, 175.289]}, {"a": 175.95999999999998, "b": 177.559, "t": "There is very little foam,", "k": ["little"], "w": [176.01, 176.358, 176.537, 176.829, 177.233]}, {"a": 177.559, "b": 180.72, "t": "so it is smooth, small, and still very strong.", "k": ["smooth,"], "w": [177.609, 177.788, 177.968, 178.147, 178.635, 179.067, 179.303, 179.65, 179.942]}, {"a": 180.72, "b": 185.54999999999998, "t": "Drink number seven is probably the most famous one: the cappuccino.", "k": ["cappuccino."], "w": [180.77, 181.161, 181.615, 182.006, 182.208, 182.788, 183.053, 183.381, 183.835, 184.194, 184.459]}, {"